CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Crossnumber_Puzzle&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Crossnumber Puzzle (page does not exist)\">Crossnumber Puzzle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Logic_Puzzle&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Logic Puzzle (page does not exist)\">Logic Puzzle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1\">Practice Relay 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2\">Practice Relay 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3\">Practice Relay 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 4\">Practice Relay 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1\">Relay A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 2\">Relay A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 3\">Relay A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Relay A 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti